                                "sense_id": "36c6b84f-a9fb-3e94-b571-dc4348fcb9d7",
                                "text": "The yogi, or disciple, who has by these means overcome the obscurations of his lower nature sufficiently, enters into the condition termed samâdhi, and ‘comes face to face with facts which no instinct or reason can ever know.’"
                            }
